{"title": "Lightly Armoured", "pageid": 4941, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Lightly_Armoured", "categories": ["Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Lightly_Armoured.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Lightly_Armoured.webp/300px-Lightly_Armoured.webp, /w/images/7/7a/Lightly_Armoured.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Lightly_Armoured.webp/300px-Lightly_Armoured.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7a/Lightly_Armoured.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Lightly Armoured</b> is a passive feature provided by the <a href=\"/wiki/Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feat\">Feat</a> of the same name. You gain Light Armour Proficiency if you didn't have it already, and +1 to Strength or Dexterity.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You gain <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency#Armour_Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">Armour Proficiency</a> with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour#List_of_light_armour\" title=\"Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Light_Armour_Icon.png/25px-Light_Armour_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Light_Armour_Icon.png/38px-Light_Armour_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Light_Armour_Icon.png/50px-Light_Armour_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Light armour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Light_Armour_Icon.png/25px-Light_Armour_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/17/Light_Armour_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour#List_of_light_armour\" title=\"Armour\">Light armour</a> and your <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> increases by 1, to a maximum of 20. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the feats:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Lightly_Armoured_(Feat)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightly Armoured (Feat)\">Lightly Armoured (Feat)</a>\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201228\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.035 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 618/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3371/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1866/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 17/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 694833/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   30.222      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   30.222      1 -total\n 40.23%   12.159      1 Template:LightArmour\n 39.26%   11.865      1 Template:Icon_link\n 38.22%   11.550      1 Template:Icon_text\n 34.66%   10.475      2 Template:Trim\n 22.39%    6.768      1 Template:Ifempty\n 13.76%    4.158      1 Template:PageSeo\n 12.78%    3.861      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 11.78%    3.560      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:4941-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201228 and revision id 396808. Rendering was triggered because: un